					{{- __('Switch', 'wp-cinquante-et-un') -}}
				</h3>
				<p class="text-gray-500 max-w-prose text-sm">
					{{-
						__(
							'Binary toggle with role="switch". Square track matches the starter radius.',
							'wp-cinquante-et-un'
						)
